  nodeTextLayers:
  - This is a snapshot of the early stages of the insulin vesicle maturation process
    and the crystal formation unique to beta cells.
  - This shows the enrichment of active insulin in the vesicle that can eventually
    be secreted into the bloodstream.
  - Insulin is densely packed to enhance efficiency for storing and secreting by
    the pancreatic beta cell.
